pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bodybg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 26, 400, 18]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: "05 · 结论"}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 46, 720, 34]
    content: {style: "$pagetitle", wrap: false, text: 测试结论：关键数字与适用边界}
  - elementId: secnum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [832, 22, 80, 38]
    content: {fontSize: 28, bold: true, color: "$soft", align: [right, middle], wrap: false, text: "05"}
  - elementId: hrule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 92, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: hrule-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 90, 56, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: concl-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 110, 440, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 12, bold: true, color: "$pass", wrap: false, text: 结论}
  - elementId: concl-list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 134, 440, 280]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p><strong>1</strong>　199 项用例全部实现 pytest 自动化，一键运行，15.55 s 完成；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>2</strong>　188 通过、0 失败；11 项跳过均为 CUDA 相关，不计为通过；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>3</strong>　三个指定模块语句 / 分支综合覆盖 79.43%，提交后全套复验升至 81.00%；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>4</strong>　3 项产品缺陷均完成"复现 — 修复 — 回归"闭环，修复前后证据齐备；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>5</strong>　用例、需求、缺陷与执行记录逐项对应，结果可复现。</p>
  - elementId: limit-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [530, 110, 382, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 12, bold: true, color: "$fail", wrap: false, text: 适用边界（不构成结论的部分）}
  - elementId: limit-list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [530, 134, 382, 120]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p>· CUDA 路径未实测（本机无 GPU）；</p>
        <p>· 语句 / 分支覆盖不等于条件、路径完全覆盖；</p>
        <p>· 完整训练与真实数据精度未验证；</p>
        <p>· 覆盖率仅针对三个指定模块。</p>
  - elementId: next-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [530, 268, 382, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 12, bold: true, color: "$primary", wrap: false, text: 后续（模块二 · AI 融合实践进行中）}
  - elementId: next-list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [530, 292, 382, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: 16 项 AI 辅助用例全部通过；新发现的 patch 归一化缓存缺陷已修复并回归。
  - elementId: recheck-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [530, 356, 300, 124]
    src: media/recheck_all.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    crop: {right: 0.25, bottom: 0.42}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: recheck-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [530, 484, 382, 14]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      wrap: false
      text: 图 4　提交后全套复验报告（215 项，204 通过）。
  - elementId: frule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 508, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: fleft
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 514, 400, 14]
    content: {fontSize: 9, color: "$muted", wrap: false, text: 软件测试与质量保证实践 · 模块一成果汇报}
  - elementId: fright
    elementType: text
    bounds: [812, 514, 100, 14]
    content: {fontSize: 9, color: "$muted", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "11 / 12"}
